          "id": "a",
          "domain": "Width w>0 and length w+4>0.",
          "derivation": "w(w+4)=60 gives (w-6)(w+10)=0; reject w=-10. Perimeter=2(6+10)=32.",
          "result": "32",
          "units": "cm"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "domain": "Both sides positive.",
          "derivation": "Side sum is 62/2=31. A side s satisfies s(31-s)=210, or (s-10)(s-21)=0. The pair (10,21) has product 210 and perimeter 62.",
          "result": ["10", "21"],
          "units": "m"
        }
      ],
      "missing_source": []
    },
